Rejected at hardness gate H.

The native Track B construction cleared G and V, plus deterministic gates G1–G8. However, the oracle pool solved every permitted difficulty rung—including the final escalation:

- Easy: 2/3 solved
- Medium: 2/3 solved
- Hard: 1/3 solved
- Final escalation: 1/3 solved

The script-owned verdict is `too_easy`, so further tuning is forbidden. G9 was therefore not run.

Evidence:

- [REJECTED.md](/Users/jang-wongi/Desktop/WG/PI_LAB/arxiv-gv-problems/results/2507.21656/REJECTED.md)
- [Oracle transcript](/Users/jang-wongi/Desktop/WG/PI_LAB/arxiv-gv-problems/results/2507.21656/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [Experimental module](/Users/jang-wongi/Desktop/WG/PI_LAB/arxiv-gv-problems/results/2507.21656/gen_2507_21656.py)

